                ("BigQuant 量化择时专题", "https://bigquant.com/wiki/topic/37fa3048b9?page=4"),
                ("中证投服:量化投资策略解析", "https://www.investor.org.cn/xxzx/tjzl/tjnrgmjytx/bk/kj/202303/P020230320379381064879.pdf"),
